      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Result"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The RBS ladder spans 31-fold, against 9-fold for the promoter ladder in the same backbone. Tuning moves to the RBS for the remainder of the programme."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Caveat carried forward"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "These RBSs are monocistronic and therefore context-sensitive: the 5\u2032 UTR formed with the downstream CDS changes their effective strength. This ladder is only valid for "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-694681f1",
              "label": "E1010m (mRFP)",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-694681f1",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/E1010m_CD",
              "contentHash": null,
              "objectUuid": null
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". Entry 14 addresses it with bicistronic designs."
          }
        ]
      },
